  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"May 17-24, 2012."</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Over the course of one week in May 2012, Alec Soth &amp; Brad Zellar visited a dozen towns and cities throughout Ohio in search of community life, and along the way recorded the faces and voices of people longing to connect with their neighbors. This newspaper was published one week after Soth &amp; Zellar returned from Ohio"--Publisher's web site.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The special edition consists of a hand-bound library buckram portfolio with a black and white photograph by Alec Soth affixed to the cover; a copy of Ohio Dispatch #1 signed by Alec Soth and Brad Zellar; and a signed, numbered limited edition print by Alec Soth.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Condition: no library markings, in protective enclosure.</subfield>
  </datafield>
